{"headword":"חֵטְא","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.9\">Dt 15:9</a></sup> <strong>sin (</strong>on format. v. Lag<sup>BN 142</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.17\">Lv 19:17</a> + 15 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶטְאוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.15\">Lv 24:15</a> + 5 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲטָאָו֯</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:39\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.39\">La 3:39</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶטְאָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.20\">Lv 20:20</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲטָאִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:4\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.4\">Ec 10:4</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲטָאֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:29\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.29\">2 K 10:29</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:49\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.49\">Ez 23:49</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲטָאַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:9\" href=\"/Genesis.41.9\">Gn 41:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲטָאָ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.17\">Is 38:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:11\" href=\"/Psalms.51.11\">ψ 51:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲטָאֵינוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:16\" href=\"/Daniel.9.16\">Dn 9:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:10\" href=\"/Psalms.103.10\">ψ 103:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲטָאֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.18\">Is 1:18</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>sin:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"against man <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:9\" href=\"/Genesis.41.9\">Gn 41:9</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:4\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.4\">Ec 10:4</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"elsewhere ag. God, abs. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 31:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.31.7\">Is 31:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:9\" href=\"/Hosea.12.9\">Ho 12:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ חָטָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:8\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.8\">La 1:8</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.15\">Dt 19:15</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:29\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.29\">2 K 10:29</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ משׁפט מות</span> <em>sin</em> worthy of death <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.22\">Dt 21:22</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ מות</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.26\">22:26</a>; with <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span>, <em>because of</em>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:16\" href=\"/Daniel.9.16\">Dn 9:16</a>; God is entreated: <em>hide thy face from my sins</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:11\" href=\"/Psalms.51.11\">ψ 51:11</a>; and it is said in faith, <em>thou wilt cast behind thy back all my sins</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.17\">Is 38:17</a>."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>guilt of sin:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">היה חטא ב</span> <em>sin</em> (the guilt of sin) <em>come on one</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.9\">Dt 15:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.22\">23:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.15\">24:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בחטאו מת</span> <em>in his sin</em> (guilt) <em>die</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 27:3\" href=\"/Numbers.27.3\">Nu 27:3</a> (P); <span dir=\"rtl\">אישׁ בחטאו</span> <em>each for his own sin</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.16\">Dt 24:16</a> + <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.16\">2 K 14:16</a> + <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.4\">2 Ch 25:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בחטא יחמתני אמי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:7\" href=\"/Psalms.51.7\">ψ 51:7</a> <em>in sin</em> (condition of sin and guilt) <em>my mother conceived me;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">אם חטאיכם כשׁנים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.18\">Is 1:18</a> <em>though your sins be like scarlet</em>(in guilt); <span dir=\"rtl\">לא כחטאינו עשׂה לנו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:10\" href=\"/Psalms.103.10\">ψ 103:10</a> <em>not according to our sins</em> (their guilt) <em>hath he done to us</em>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>punishment for sin:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׂא ח׳</span> <em>bear sin</em> (its punishment) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.20\">Lv 20:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.15\">24:15</a> (H), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 9:13\" href=\"/Numbers.9.13\">Nu 9:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:22\" href=\"/Numbers.18.22\">18:22</a> (P); with <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span>, <em>bear sin because of</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.17\">Lv 19:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.9\">22:9</a> (H) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:32\" href=\"/Numbers.18.32\">Nu 18:32</a> (P); bear sins of idols (in worshipping idols) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:49\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.49\">Ez 23:49</a>; the ideal servant of Yahweh <em>bore the sins of many</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.12\">Is 53:12</a>; without <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׂא</span>, only <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:39\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.39\">La 3:39</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">גבר על חטאו</span> (wherefore doth) <em>a man</em> (complain) <em>for the punishment of his sin?</em>"}],"num":"3."}]},"rid":"BDB02998","strong_numbers":["2399"],"next_hw":"חַטָּא","prev_hw":"חָטָא","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["2628"],"TWOT":["638a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}